    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690230/extras/664bf66f52b772a0b1908e510b691577.avif?t=1755334142\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Background</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Bamboo House&quot; is a place where talented men and beautiful women, and political schemes are intertwined...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a mysterious passer-by here. Use wisdom and strategy to uncover the secrets of various characters in the bamboo house and experience a lingering interactive story. The game is based on ancient style, integrating poetry and sensuality, leading players to immerse themselves in the extravagant ancient night banquet~</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690230/extras/08062cd95b879cbc9eda26c26cb65547.poster.avif?t=1755334142\" width=600 height=322 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690230/extras/08062cd95b879cbc9eda26c26cb65547.webm?t=1755334142\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690230/extras/08062cd95b879cbc9eda26c26cb65547.mp4?t=1755334142\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690230/extras/2092e85a4defd23e272257b63bda394b.poster.avif?t=1755334142\" width=600 height=406 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690230/extras/2092e85a4defd23e272257b63bda394b.webm?t=1755334142\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690230/extras/2092e85a4defd23e272257b63bda394b.mp4?t=1755334142\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Main gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a casual flip card game. Players flip cards in a beautiful card matrix. Each card has a corresponding CG picture. Players need to match white and tender jade feet or beautiful legs () to successfully pass the level to unlock a beautiful and hot full-motion CG</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690230/extras/9d0848e029bd804827965d64c0365d16.poster.avif?t=1755334142\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690230/extras/9d0848e029bd804827965d64c0365d16.webm?t=1755334142\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690230/extras/9d0848e029bd804827965d64c0365d16.mp4?t=1755334142\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A charming courtesan, a pure yet scheming maid, a bohemian dancer, a hidden aristocrat. Each character has a unique storyline and CG content, with different personalities and interactive styles. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sweet Japanese interactive dubbing (Chinese dubbing is under negotiation)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The CG plot unabashedly shows sexual scenes, including ancient Chinese style, for an ultimate sense of immersion</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The interactive mode allows players to customize scene details and choose character costumes (semi-transparent gauze or nude)</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690230/extras/664bf66f52b772a0b1908e510b691577.avif?t=1755334142\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Background</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Bamboo House&quot; is a place where talented men and beautiful women, and political schemes are intertwined...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a mysterious passer-by here. Use wisdom and strategy to uncover the secrets of various characters in the bamboo house and experience a lingering interactive story. The game is based on ancient style, integrating poetry and sensuality, leading players to immerse themselves in the extravagant ancient night banquet~</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690230/extras/08062cd95b879cbc9eda26c26cb65547.poster.avif?t=1755334142\" width=600 height=322 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690230/extras/08062cd95b879cbc9eda26c26cb65547.webm?t=1755334142\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690230/extras/08062cd95b879cbc9eda26c26cb65547.mp4?t=1755334142\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690230/extras/2092e85a4defd23e272257b63bda394b.poster.avif?t=1755334142\" width=600 height=406 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690230/extras/2092e85a4defd23e272257b63bda394b.webm?t=1755334142\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690230/extras/2092e85a4defd23e272257b63bda394b.mp4?t=1755334142\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Main gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a casual flip card game. Players flip cards in a beautiful card matrix. Each card has a corresponding CG picture. Players need to match white and tender jade feet or beautiful legs () to successfully pass the level to unlock a beautiful and hot full-motion CG</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690230/extras/9d0848e029bd804827965d64c0365d16.poster.avif?t=1755334142\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690230/extras/9d0848e029bd804827965d64c0365d16.webm?t=1755334142\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690230/extras/9d0848e029bd804827965d64c0365d16.mp4?t=1755334142\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A charming courtesan, a pure yet scheming maid, a bohemian dancer, a hidden aristocrat. Each character has a unique storyline and CG content, with different personalities and interactive styles. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sweet Japanese interactive dubbing (Chinese dubbing is under negotiation)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The CG plot unabashedly shows sexual scenes, including ancient Chinese style, for an ultimate sense of immersion</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The interactive mode allows players to customize scene details and choose character costumes (semi-transparent gauze or nude)</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "&quot;Deep in the stillness of the night, the wind drums against the bamboos. Who will pity my lonely figure, facing the empty bed?&quot; Sir, this lonely beauty is eagerly awaiting you, her delicate body craving your \ud83c\udf46 comfort.",
